$ pace client add acme --name ACME GmbH --currency EUR   # at 08:58
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the client `acme` (ACME GmbH) in EUR.
pace took these defaults: no rate and no rounding; `pace client edit acme` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace role add work --name Work   # at 08:59
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the role `work` (Work, area).
pace took these defaults: kind `area`, no purpose and no weekly target; `pace role edit` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace project add webshop --client acme   # at 09:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the project `webshop` (webshop) for the client `acme`, billable.
pace took these defaults: name `webshop` from the key, no role and billable, as it has a client; `pace project edit webshop` changes them.

